## Development

```bash
# Clone and install in development mode
git clone https://github.com/iflexvault/fampay-verify
cd fampay-verify
pip install -e ".[dev]"

# Run tests
pytest

# Format code
black fampay_verify examples
ruff check fampay_verify examples

# Type check
mypy fampay_verify
```

